  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TwFil.tw_fil | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TwFil.tw_fil | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.TwFil.tw_fil <;> assumption)
